	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES - POWER MONITOR\n\n3 x PAC1954 (4-ch V+I, energy accumulators) on shared I2C, ALERT wired-OR to P4.\nPM1: VBUS_USER, VBAT, VSYS, 5V_SDR\nPM2: 5V_LCD, 3V3_P4, 3V3_C5, 3V3_ETH\nPM3: 3V3_GPS, 3V3_M1421, 3V3_PERIPH, 5V total\nKelvin sense from each shunt + Kelvin test pads. I2C addresses set by ADDRSEL resistor (TBC)."
